ow\": \"The lab management board updates the existing project-review calendar; each gate gains one additional reviewer slot dedicated to record-keeping adequacy, funded from our current administrative budget rather than new headcount.\",\n\"why\": \"This prevents late-stage compliance surprises that stall deployments and force expensive rework, protecting both timeline predictability and grant-funder confidence in our delivery capacity.\"\n},\n{\n\"title\": \"Researching Low-Overhead Logging for Constrained Models\",\n\"what\": \"A twelve-month internal research project exploring how to implement Article 12-mandated event recording with minimal compute and memory overhead, specifically targeting our edge-deployed and resource-constrained model classes.\",\n\"how\": \"One postdoc and two PhD students are assigned from the systems group; we leverage our existing GPU-cluster time allocation and publish findings in an open-access venue to build institutional technical reputation.\",\n\"why\": \"Solving this efficiently protects our hardware budget margin, generates a citable contribution that strengthens future grant applications, and positions the lab as a reference implementer for the regulation.\"\n}\n]\n}",
