umentation sections changed per commit.\",\n\"why\": \"It keeps technical documentation current throughout the system lifetime at near-zero marginal cost, eliminating the end-of-project documentation scramble that currently slows our prototyping-to-deployment handoff by weeks.\"\n}\n]\n}",
